INMP441       ESP32-S3
----------------------
SCK       →   GPIO2
WS        →   GPIO1
SD        →   GPIO42
L/R       →   GND
VDD       →   3.3V
GND       →   GND

MAX98357A     ESP32-S3
----------------------
BCLK      →   GPIO40
LRC       →   GPIO41
DIN       →   GPIO39
GND       →   GND
VIN       →   appropriate amplifier supply

NOTE: This may be outdated...alwaays verify by looking at the firmware.